id=shark8_audiovol_bind
name=Shark8 Earpiece Volume Fix (bind variant)
version=v1.1
versionCode=2
author=Bastet
description=Patches SpeechVol_AudioParam.xml (WB,RCV,GSM / WB,HAC,GSM dl_gain 4->12 dB) via bind-mount in post-fs-data.sh. No vendor/ tree in module -> KSU mounts no overlay -> no boot hang (standalone KSU overlay on /vendor hangs boot on this device). /vendor stays read-only.